


OLDASSN(1)	    UNIX Programmer's Manual	       OLDASSN(1)



NAME
     oldassn - search for instances of old C assignment operators

SYNOPSIS
     oldassn file ...

DESCRIPTION
     _o_l_d_a_s_s_n searches for [possible] instances of old C assign-
     ment operators in the specified _f_i_l_es.  Suspicious lines are
     printed out ala _g_r_e_p(1).













































